# Non-secret settings for the deployed Cloud Function (project fly-with-pegasus).
#
# The Firebase CLI reads this file at deploy time and sets each line as an environment
# variable on the function. Only PUBLIC values belong here — this file is committed.
# Keys, tokens and anything else sensitive go in Cloud Secret Manager instead (see
# DEPLOY.md step 4); the function binds them by name in src/function.ts.
#
# Optional. A vector Map ID enables tilt and heading for turn-by-turn navigation.
# Create one at Google Cloud console → Google Maps Platform → Map management, then paste
# it here. Blank is fine: navigation works north-up and flat.
GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID=
